02:44:16.139 --> 02:44:19.776
to suddenly intensely roll out programmes.

02:44:19.776 --> 02:44:22.890
- Briefly, I just wanted to make it clear

02:44:22.890 --> 02:44:24.930
how closely Amanda and I worked together

02:44:24.930 --> 02:44:26.718
