some of the things.

02:44:26.718 --> 02:44:28.884
So it's often, you know,

02:44:28.884 --> 02:44:30.953
talking about UEC and this is like,

02:44:30.953 --> 02:44:33.060
they're sort of separate things,

02:44:33.060 --> 02:44:35.691
but when we are supporting
