02:44:49.920 --> 02:44:51.930
How are we doing
everything we possibly can

02:44:51.930 --> 02:44:53.400
to ensure delivery?

02:44:53.400 --> 02:44:55.590
So we've got some
universal approaches to it.

02:44:55.590 --> 02:44:57.210
We've got some targeted approaches to it.

02:44:57.210 --> 02:44:59.773
And absolutely where we
